    "Id": "mechdef_thug_THG-14M",
    "Name": "Thug THG-14M",
    "Details": "The THG-14M focuses on long-range striking power. The standard armor is replaced with  ferro-fibrous plate, but total protection remains unchanged from the base 10E machine. All weapons are removed and the heatsinks are replaced with ten double heatsinks. Technicians first mounted an ER PPC in the torso. Next, they installed a Gauss rifle in the right arm, protected by CASE and supplied with two tons of ferro-nickel slugs. Finally, a cluster of five medium lasers are housed in the left arm. The result is a 'Mech with increased range and punch which sacrifices a bit of the 13M's short range firepower.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Energy</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.14</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_thug"
  },
